There is Fora Dictionary for Android <http://ng-comp.com/fora/android.htm>. 
It supports dsl dictionary format. Most lojban dictionaries have been 
converted to dsl.
There can be some bugs when viewing them in Fora, though. But I'm not sure.
DSL dictionaries can be downloaded from here<https://sites.google.com/site/slovlacukt/file-cabinet>
